      "q": "How do you expand (a + b) to the power 4?",
      "a": "a to the 4, plus 4 a cubed b, plus 6 a squared b squared, plus 4 a b cubed, plus b to the 4. The numbers 1, 4, 6, 4, 1 come from Pascal's triangle.",
