        "What is (a+b)^4?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "q": "How does Pascal's triangle work?",
      "a": "Start with 1 at the top. Each row starts and ends with 1, and every other number is the sum of the two numbers just above it.",
      "asks": [
        "How do you build Pascal's triangle?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "q": "Why is the middle coefficient 6?",
      "a": "You need b from exactly 2 of the 4 brackets. The number of ways to choose 2 brackets from 4 is 4 choose 2, which is 6.",
      "asks": [
        "Why is there a 6 in (a+b)^4?"
      ]
